            <div xml:id="m-b9d32dda-1d44-4472-ae7a-44e755a7b9d0">
              <lg xml:id="m-383ca6dc-54ea-457e-9409-00719d5b6882">
                <l xml:id="m-4901d479-0779-4974-97fa-a5b7ce5abfb4" facs="#m-94c7bb66-0d19-4d74-8d3c-2551a7f09c4c" label="ambiguous">1206</l><l xml:id="m-529d133b-fba0-4bd5-a26f-b8f007bdf2f1" facs="#m-7f0aa112-fd0e-4e1d-8636-32932144114b" label="text-like">Common of Abbots. Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-73c9b8df-bccb-43e8-9803-31d1db61329f" facs="#m-488b3cc6-8658-40db-9008-864cdba3187c" label="ambiguous">i. T. P. Al¬</l><l xml:id="m-eaa5deab-7383-49f3-8afe-8328e7e6fdb1" facs="#m-ab95b7a5-87e1-4638-b91f-b751e4222901" label="lyrics-like">tribu-i-sti é¬</l><l xml:id="m-44b7d61c-c605-4593-85fd-0ebd8b0181f2" facs="#m-dc69f7a6-5890-4691-8ede-9a7c22ea8e07" label="ambiguous">jus</l><l xml:id="m-be4d1d26-4a4c-4f6a-864b-8f440d3446ec" facs="#m-7beb987c-6992-4795-bb86-ab6223d593aa" label="ambiguous">le¬</l><l xml:id="m-dc487323-65aa-4256-9fac-22a0a8aaea83" facs="#m-a0869316-7aa1-462b-80cd-f20da0ca0d86" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia.</l><l xml:id="m-6d741d1e-f27c-4705-a8d3-37b3dfd2664c" facs="#m-828daa1b-9f8c-444d-afab-e60755124301" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-fc2334f2-d348-43af-858b-5dc43841f09b" facs="#m-e74aa52f-fcb1-466a-9d3f-b9209b047b3e" label="lyrics-like">ORaesta nobis, quaésumus omni-grata sit honóre Sanctórum, et nos</l><l xml:id="m-937b53d9-e1b0-49ff-92cf-0abce220f3e2" facs="#m-c8f3e25d-b3dd-4d82-8f0a-80ed4fbd68fd" label="lyrics-like">Epotens Deus: ut nostrae hu-córpore páriter et mente puríficet.</l><l xml:id="m-edf373ec-47ee-486c-9b74-bf719007735c" facs="#m-8b10d317-fc60-499a-9772-da5dc63afdd1" label="lyrics-like">militátis oblátio, et pro tuórum tibi Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-00cafb4d-a7d0-40e8-ae53-32d1c4f53951" facs="#m-97b2f5a3-8a50-486e-a314-611abad07234" label="ambiguous">comm.</l><l xml:id="m-a7b5bf9a-9dfa-497e-bc1a-01cfa4ee5a02" facs="#m-5bed3ba3-ad29-41c6-bcb0-006842481a44" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-0247ea4b-09bd-473b-b6b4-71036d358823" facs="#m-e7a5e05f-1208-4f6f-853c-85087119c46d" label="lyrics-like">-men “dí-co vó¬</l><l xml:id="m-15f4a753-92c4-40df-8a7a-ac625de4f106" facs="#m-5e96f02d-bbe8-44c5-92ca-894df4980b80" label="ambiguous">bis:</l><l xml:id="m-4f07cde4-904c-4de9-920c-b63f25f53699" facs="#m-7d790dd1-9ce1-49df-b67b-231609d907a1" label="ambiguous">quod vos, qui</l><l xml:id="m-d4561a9d-3c14-458c-8ced-0d4c0630e92b" facs="#m-8b54525c-de12-4a6f-98c6-837e2483d00d" label="lyrics-like">re-liquístis ómni¬ a et secú-ti é-stis me,</l><l xml:id="m-7420114b-ce8a-4cb5-832d-9b8b37145d97" facs="#m-382e48a2-dd70-4b56-b82e-97ee3aff2d03" label="lyrics-like">céntu¬</l><l xml:id="m-8a7f1885-a5ff-445c-aeeb-37b0735759e8" facs="#m-fc4ec55d-aa7f-4066-9d55-20be33945204" label="lyrics-like">plum acci-pi-é- tis, et ví-tam aetér- nam</l><l xml:id="m-0672084c-f482-4252-87f0-6448c2d87ded" facs="#m-bf3d70be-47be-44dc-a5f2-e3e4b911b07e" label="ambiguous">pos- si¬</l><l xml:id="m-981a8ff7-239f-4a6b-bf32-b4632c28015d" facs="#m-3d9e969a-a0dd-456c-bb9e-a5212d3afe07" label="lyrics-like">débi- tis. T. P. Alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-893b24ee-e05c-4c23-ad8e-0cae62a3f313" facs="#m-c014bafd-b083-45ee-b7db-23be29e30503" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia.</l><l xml:id="m-8af58ede-3f98-490b-bb2a-04d2fc362a71" facs="#m-bf4acdd3-c89d-411f-b932-7dd232ca594c" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-e89933ae-c277-4ff4-a08e-e6c7572f5e31" facs="#m-69c43377-6f67-41e7-80fd-7095c3fcf53c" label="lyrics-like">Uaésumus, omnípotens Deus:  fessóre tuo, per haec contra ómnia</l><l xml:id="m-063d5f2b-5324-4469-9f4b-1d15f55a58b0" facs="#m-46c637a0-eadf-430e-87ba-34b34bb57df9" label="lyrics-like">Uut, qui caeléstia aliménta per-]advérsa muniámur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-723a8693-2dda-4306-b98c-b7a677cbeba5" facs="#m-3d085b7e-0f4b-4264-a717-e11ddb7ffb4a" label="lyrics-like">cépimus, intercedénte beáto N. Con¬</l><l xml:id="m-4d426e11-dd3a-4cd1-8138-561be9ed9f0b" facs="#m-2618f92a-03ea-49eb-b436-d7d25b331ffc" label="ambiguous">~    .      .  --- = a</l><l xml:id="m-30fd69ef-42e1-48f0-836b-3490bdd23375" facs="#m-b1a9925e-389c-47c6-b0fe-551977550e62" label="text-like">COMMON OF ABBOTS.</l><l xml:id="m-2c811940-d9e2-4d41-872f-438194abfe45" facs="#m-4d506c07-3650-43d9-804f-daac2a0fd0c4" label="text-like">The Office for an Abbot is that of a Confessor not a Bishop. excent the</l><l xml:id="m-aeed6e62-d6ce-4d53-adf6-9f5cb716ab29" facs="#m-7e0313dc-ed1c-4244-8500-c2438c2945ad" label="lyrics-like">Prayer which is Intercéssio. as below.</l><l xml:id="m-ca5b019a-74fd-4efd-9dc4-4f395905746a" facs="#m-36f672e9-77f2-47cf-b036-8c8cac99f5a9" label="text-like">MASS FOR ABBOTS.</l><l xml:id="m-38e1c55a-f799-492b-b791-be27a64c475e" facs="#m-1c2400b6-6006-4bab-8819-d7f7a521496d" label="lyrics-like">Introit. Os jústi. p. 1200.</l><l xml:id="m-0cad0ac7-d32f-45b2-927e-0e620a407d94" facs="#m-49cd1a34-746b-4e16-bdfb-dfa08b07ae18" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-4eb0589a-b1a6-4c5d-a57a-7d1a9346a294" facs="#m-2d2744ca-ce01-4a66-82eb-ea983560fd10" label="lyrics-like">Ntercéssio nos, quaésumus Dó-valémus, " ejus patrocinio assequá¬</l><l xml:id="m-686d5ce6-d81e-4eae-a032-a83fe8c1d3b5" facs="#m-69cf4e0a-d92d-477e-aef9-735008017b4d" label="lyrics-like">L mine, beáti N. Abbátis commén¬</l><l xml:id="m-1fb17ede-63b1-4db5-8c0b-435b1bd6b206" facs="#m-b74e9bcf-4c21-4bdf-ab51-15cdd9a9ab55" label="lyrics-like">mur. Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-090c4f8e-0015-4ddb-8dd0-ee7fb622048e" facs="#m-60637317-d4f1-4937-b41a-df5adc98654a" label="lyrics-like">det:t ut quod nostris méritis non</l></lg>
